Die offizielle WireGuard-App für den Mac:
The official WireGuard app for the Mac is only available in the App Store (free, by WireGuard Development Team). There is no official way to install it automatically – Homebrew only brings the command-line tools without the app.

{ganzer_rechner}

The App Store opens in a moment: click “Get” there. Then in the WireGuard app choose “Import tunnel(s) from file”, select your .conf, allow macOS the VPN configuration and click “Activate”.

